+```
+
+#### contact-chainID
+A c++ program to calculate all heavy atom interchain contacts (where the chain identification is taken from the chainID) within a given distance cutoff in Angstrom.
+
+Usage:
+```bash
+   contact-chainID <pdb file> <cutoff>
+```
